  "details": "Personal Licenses can sometimes expiry and Unity Hub asks you to just go and click a button to accept the new license, easy on Unity Hub side, but if you open a project on Creator Companion and receive the error that you don't have a license (which ask you to open Unity Hub), it hangs trying to open the project and you need to restart if you want to try again. Don't know how easy reproducible is this bug, because I already got my license.\n\n1 - Unity Hub Expired License (Return License?)\n\n2 - Tries to open a project on Creator Companion\n\n3 - Unity fails to open citing a lack of license to open\n\n4 - Open Unity Hub, get a new license\n\n5 - CC still trying to open the project even though Unity is closed",
